<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant-TW">
    <head>
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, shrink-to-fit=no">
        <meta charset="utf-8">
        <title>EPUB 簡轉繁｜線上將簡體中文電子書轉為繁體中文</title>
        <meta name="description" content="免費線上 EPUB 簡轉繁工具，將簡體中文 EPUB 電子書轉換為臺灣繁體中文。免安裝、支援拖放，上傳後立即轉換並下載。">
        <meta name="robots" content="index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1">
        <link rel="canonical" href="{{ canonical_url }}">
        <meta property="og:locale" content="zh_TW">
        <meta property="og:type" content="website">
        <meta property="og:site_name" content="EPUB 簡轉繁">
        <meta property="og:title" content="EPUB 簡轉繁｜簡體中文電子書轉繁體中文">
        <meta property="og:description" content="免費、免安裝的線上 EPUB 簡轉繁工具。上傳簡體中文電子書，立即下載繁體中文版。">
        <meta property="og:url" content="{{ canonical_url }}">
        <!-- Tocas UI：CSS 與元件 -->
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/tocas-ui/4.0.4/tocas.css">
        <!-- Tocas JS：模塊與 JavaScript 函式 -->
        <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/tocas-ui/4.0.4/tocas.js"></script>
        <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ url_for('static', filename='main.css') }}">
        <meta name="keywords" content="epub,EPUB,chinese,ebook,電子書,簡體,繁體,簡繁轉換,簡轉繁,簡體轉繁體,線上工具">
        <script type="application/ld+json">{{ {
            "@context": "https://schema.org",
            "@type": "WebApplication",
            "name": "EPUB 簡轉繁",
            "url": canonical_url,
            "applicationCategory": "UtilitiesApplication",
            "operatingSystem": "任何支援網頁瀏覽器的系統",
            "inLanguage": "zh-Hant-TW",
            "description": "將簡體中文 EPUB 電子書轉換為臺灣繁體中文的免費線上工具",
            "offers": {"@type": "Offer", "price": "0", "priceCurrency": "TWD"}
        }|tojson }}</script>
    </head>
    <body>
        <form action="{{ endpoint }}" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" name="form" id="form">
            <input type="file" name="upload" id="upload" accept=".epub" />
        </form>
        <div class="switch-container">
            <label class="ts-switch">
                <input type="checkbox" id="theme-switch" />
                <i class="ts-icon" id="theme-icon"></i>
            </label>
        </div>
        <header class="ts-header is-center-aligned is-huge">
            <div class="ts-content is-padded">EPUB 簡轉繁</div>
        </header>
        <div class="ts-center" id="main">
            <div class="ts-space"></div>
            <div class="ts-container">
                <div class="ts-box is-hollowed" id="dragzone" data-mode="selecting">
                    <span class="ts-close"></span>
                    <div class="ts-content is-very-padded">
                        <div class="ts-center">
                            <!-- Header & Description -->
                            <div class="ts-header is-large">上傳</div>
                            <div class="ts-text is-center-aligned is-secondary">將檔案拖拉至此處進行上傳，或是點擊此處選取檔案。<br>{{ limit_human_readable }}</div>

                            <div class="ts-space"></div>

                            <!-- Buttons / Progress bar -->
                            <button class="ts-button is-primary" id="submitbtn">開始轉換</button>
                            <a class="ts-button is-positive" id="downloadbtn">下載繁體 EPUB</a>
                            <div class="ts-progress" id="progressbar">
                                <div class="bar" style="--value: 0;"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="symbol">
                        <span class="ts-icon is-upload-icon"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="ts-space"></div>
        </div>
        <section class="ts-container seo-content" aria-labelledby="about-title">
            <h1 class="ts-header is-large" id="about-title">線上 EPUB 簡體轉繁體</h1>
            <p>上傳簡體中文 EPUB 電子書，即可轉換為臺灣繁體中文。系統會轉換書籍內文、目錄、檔名與語言標記，完成後直接下載，不需安裝軟體。</p>
            <h2 class="ts-header">如何將簡體 EPUB 轉成繁體？</h2>
            <ol>
                <li>拖放或選取一個 EPUB 檔案。</li>
                <li>點選「開始轉換」，等待處理完成。</li>
                <li>點選「下載繁體 EPUB」儲存電子書。</li>
            </ol>
            <p>單一檔案上限為 4 MiB。檔案只用於本次轉換，不會建立公開書庫。</p>
        </section>
        <footer class="ts-content is-center-aligned is-tertiary">
            <p class="ts-text">將簡體 EPUB 轉換為繁體 EPUB 的線上工具。支援拖放上傳，且上傳後即刻開始轉換，數秒內即轉換完成。</p>
            <p class="ts-text">&copy; EPUB 簡轉繁 | <a class="ts-text is-link" href="https://github.com/NullKeeper-dev/epub_convert" rel="noopener">GitHub 原始碼</a></p>
        </footer>
        <!-- snackbar -->
        <div class="ts-snackbar is-fading-up">
            <div class="content"></div>
        </div>

        <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/axios/0.27.2/axios.min.js"></script>
        <script>
            const sizeLimit = {{ limit|tojson }};
            const sizeLimitLabel = {{ limit_human_readable|tojson }};
        </script>
        <script src="{{ url_for('static', filename='upload.js') }}"></script>
    </body>
</html>
